WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.720
- Speaking of girls night out, I have to say,

00:00:01.720 --> 00:00:03.670
this is one of my best moments of my life.

00:00:03.670 --> 00:00:05.520
I've had a few times that
I've randomly run into her

00:00:05.520 --> 00:00:07.420
and like, pretended it was totally normal.

00:00:07.420 --> 00:00:08.780
And I was with Reba and they were like

00:00:08.780 --> 00:00:09.613
we're going to this dinner,

00:00:09.613 --> 00:00:10.710
and I'm like, all of a
sudden, like you're there,

00:00:10.710 --> 00:00:12.460
and I'm just like, yeah,
it's totally normal.

00:00:12.460 --> 00:00:14.630
And I'm like, it matters to me.

00:00:14.630 --> 00:00:16.320
I'm like, I'm like
totally wanting to sing.

00:00:16.320 --> 00:00:17.810
Do you remember this night though?

00:00:17.810 --> 00:00:20.066
This is one of, do you remember?

00:00:20.066 --> 00:00:21.480
- [Guest] Yes.
(audience cheering)

00:00:21.480 --> 00:00:24.640
- [Kelly Clarkson] I went to
go see Shania. You did too.

00:00:24.640 --> 00:00:26.430
I was with Reba, and I was like,

00:00:26.430 --> 00:00:28.810
I was pretending, I was,

00:00:28.810 --> 00:00:30.960
I was Meryl Streep right there.

00:00:30.960 --> 00:00:33.400
I was like, so chill about it.

00:00:33.400 --> 00:00:36.790
But like legit was so excited.
- Same.

00:00:36.790 --> 00:00:38.550
Like, my friends afterwards,
we were just like,

00:00:38.550 --> 00:00:40.500
do you remember how I
pretended that was normal?

00:00:40.500 --> 00:00:42.550
Yeah. I was very excited about that night,

00:00:42.550 --> 00:00:43.850
but I was wondering,
cause we just were talking

00:00:43.850 --> 00:00:44.700
about girls nights out,

00:00:44.700 --> 00:00:45.840
do you do that with your daughters?

00:00:45.840 --> 00:00:47.080
Do you ever say Tim, you're not allowed

00:00:47.080 --> 00:00:48.110
and you just go?

00:00:48.110 --> 00:00:49.270
- [Guest] It just happened.

00:00:49.270 --> 00:00:50.103
- [Kelly Clarkson] It just happened?

00:00:50.103 --> 00:00:51.020
What'd y'all do?
- Yeah.

00:00:51.020 --> 00:00:51.880
- Well, he,

00:00:51.880 --> 00:00:52.890
he was not allowed because

00:00:52.890 --> 00:00:54.140
he was actually working.

00:00:54.140 --> 00:00:56.359
- [Kelly Clarkson] Oh. That's
a good time to do it, though.

00:00:56.359 --> 00:00:58.000
'Cause then you don't feel as bad.

00:00:58.000 --> 00:00:58.833
You're like, well you're working.

00:00:58.833 --> 00:00:59.867
It's your fault.

00:00:59.867 --> 00:01:01.770
(Kelly laughing)

00:01:01.770 --> 00:01:03.760
- That's one way to look at it I guess.

00:01:03.760 --> 00:01:05.730
Gracie, our oldest, we
have three daughters.

00:01:05.730 --> 00:01:06.563
- Yeah.

00:01:06.563 --> 00:01:09.157
- Gracie just turned 25 last week.

00:01:09.157 --> 00:01:10.560
- Wow.
- Last week, yes.

00:01:10.560 --> 00:01:11.393
- Yeah.

00:01:11.393 --> 00:01:12.420
- This week,

00:01:12.420 --> 00:01:15.130
and we went on a girl's trip,

00:01:15.130 --> 00:01:18.120
and have the best time
the four of us together,

00:01:18.120 --> 00:01:20.090
and Gracie's best friend.

00:01:20.090 --> 00:01:20.923
- [Kelly Clarkson] Yeah.

00:01:20.923 --> 00:01:22.830
- Girl, I'm all about the dancing.

00:01:22.830 --> 00:01:23.663
- Oh, I love dancing.

00:01:23.663 --> 00:01:25.650
- Now, I cannot dance at all,

00:01:25.650 --> 00:01:26.820
and I'll be the first to admit it.

00:01:26.820 --> 00:01:29.560
I know I can't dance, but I do not care.

00:01:29.560 --> 00:01:30.560
I don't care.

00:01:30.560 --> 00:01:32.170
- [Kelly Clarkson] It, should be whatever

00:01:32.170 --> 00:01:33.430
it should be, though.

00:01:33.430 --> 00:01:35.940
It's like, it feels good
just to move your body.

00:01:35.940 --> 00:01:38.030
- [Guest] I, you know, it
should be whatever it should be.

00:01:38.030 --> 00:01:38.863
- [Kelly Clarkson] Yeah.

00:01:38.863 --> 00:01:40.460
- That's when people go, mhmm.

00:01:40.460 --> 00:01:41.370
- [Kelly Clarkson] No,
you know what they say?

00:01:41.370 --> 00:01:42.580
They're like, look, I just went

00:01:42.580 --> 00:01:44.330
to a concert trail and obtain
this lady in the front.

00:01:44.330 --> 00:01:46.250
I was like one, what are you on ma'am?

00:01:46.250 --> 00:01:49.210
And two, she was living her best life,

00:01:49.210 --> 00:01:50.840
